    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BOUNCY BUTT CASTLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game all about Butts and Bouncy Castles. Drop in with your friends, Activate Star Power-ups and Squash your opponents! Bounce in the Pit that is Free For All, Conquer the World in King of the Slide or Race to come first in Sky High Parkour! Make yourself stand out by finding outfits in-game.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUTTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your rear, propel yourself in any given direction, allowing you to maneuver like a deadly spring. </p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/1d7995d25e52ec516e9ebe59866ce4ad.poster.avif?t=1752533709\" width=602 height=602 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/1d7995d25e52ec516e9ebe59866ce4ad.webm?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/1d7995d25e52ec516e9ebe59866ce4ad.mp4?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRICKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commit to flips, in different directions to fill up your launch meter allowing your gasses to propel you forwards.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/a066a1140f86b87e41ee308a6f4d2599.poster.avif?t=1752533709\" width=746 height=746 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/a066a1140f86b87e41ee308a6f4d2599.webm?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/a066a1140f86b87e41ee308a6f4d2599.mp4?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POWERUPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch yourself through stars throughout levels to earn power-ups that will aid you in battle, and assist in platforming!</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/a289d1cc41319586d432992e73dd2afc.poster.avif?t=1752533709\" width=718 height=718 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/a289d1cc41319586d432992e73dd2afc.webm?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/a289d1cc41319586d432992e73dd2afc.mp4?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEMODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a variety of gamemodes, from ones you know and love such as Free For All, or new ones such as King Of The Slide and Sky High Parkour. Each with their own set of maps.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/8228e1b6f37b2f1cc5fd47d0e9b67932.poster.avif?t=1752533709\" width=642 height=642 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/8228e1b6f37b2f1cc5fd47d0e9b67932.webm?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/8228e1b6f37b2f1cc5fd47d0e9b67932.mp4?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BOUNCE IN STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Collectiballs throughout the maps, unlocking different outfits, colours and fart trails for you to style yourself with! <i>Who has the shiniest rear of them all?</i></p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/eb50e46ebfe0f48a30ae413c067d8e5a.poster.avif?t=1752533709\" width=710 height=1076 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/eb50e46ebfe0f48a30ae413c067d8e5a.webm?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/eb50e46ebfe0f48a30ae413c067d8e5a.mp4?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BOUNCY BUTT CASTLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game all about Butts and Bouncy Castles. Drop in with your friends, Activate Star Power-ups and Squash your opponents! Bounce in the Pit that is Free For All, Conquer the World in King of the Slide or Race to come first in Sky High Parkour! Make yourself stand out by finding outfits in-game.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUTTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using your rear, propel yourself in any given direction, allowing you to maneuver like a deadly spring. </p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/1d7995d25e52ec516e9ebe59866ce4ad.poster.avif?t=1752533709\" width=602 height=602 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/1d7995d25e52ec516e9ebe59866ce4ad.webm?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/1d7995d25e52ec516e9ebe59866ce4ad.mp4?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRICKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Commit to flips, in different directions to fill up your launch meter allowing your gasses to propel you forwards.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/a066a1140f86b87e41ee308a6f4d2599.poster.avif?t=1752533709\" width=746 height=746 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/a066a1140f86b87e41ee308a6f4d2599.webm?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/a066a1140f86b87e41ee308a6f4d2599.mp4?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POWERUPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch yourself through stars throughout levels to earn power-ups that will aid you in battle, and assist in platforming!</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/a289d1cc41319586d432992e73dd2afc.poster.avif?t=1752533709\" width=718 height=718 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/a289d1cc41319586d432992e73dd2afc.webm?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/a289d1cc41319586d432992e73dd2afc.mp4?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEMODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a variety of gamemodes, from ones you know and love such as Free For All, or new ones such as King Of The Slide and Sky High Parkour. Each with their own set of maps.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/8228e1b6f37b2f1cc5fd47d0e9b67932.poster.avif?t=1752533709\" width=642 height=642 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/8228e1b6f37b2f1cc5fd47d0e9b67932.webm?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/8228e1b6f37b2f1cc5fd47d0e9b67932.mp4?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BOUNCE IN STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Collectiballs throughout the maps, unlocking different outfits, colours and fart trails for you to style yourself with! <i>Who has the shiniest rear of them all?</i></p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/eb50e46ebfe0f48a30ae413c067d8e5a.poster.avif?t=1752533709\" width=710 height=1076 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/eb50e46ebfe0f48a30ae413c067d8e5a.webm?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512730/extras/eb50e46ebfe0f48a30ae413c067d8e5a.mp4?t=1752533709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p>",
